# The Efinity installer is licensed software that may not be redistributed, and
# this repository is public. build_image.sh is usually pointed at a download
# outside the tree, but the tarball is easy to leave here after using it -- and
# one `git add -A` would publish it. Never commit these, whatever the extension.
efinity-*.tar.*
efinity-*.tar
efinity-*.msi
efinity-*.exe
